    "text": "WDAM-TV\nwebsite\nColumbia\nColumbia Police looking for suspects who vandalized a Ridgewood Community home\nBy Charles Herrington,\n2 hours agoCOLUMBIA, Miss. (WDAM) - Columbia Police need your help finding the people who vandalized a home over the weekend. The case involves an unoccupied home in the Ridgewood community. Investigators said one or more people broke into the home overnight late on Friday, July 25 or early Saturday, July 26.",
